      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. It definitely reads better than a list. \n\nHowever, I just checked the internal tool we use to preview how the ATS sees the profile, and it says this version only hits a coverage score of about 75%. To actually get into the top tier of candidates for the roles they're eyeing, we really need that score much closer to 100%. \n\nCan you try another version that ensures every single one of those terms is included? I know I said not to make it look like a list, and I'm still saying the same thing—keep it sounding like a real person wrote it—but we can't compromise on the term coverage. We need that score maximized for the ATS to trigger the recruiter alert.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
